<title>USA: First Industrial buys Wisconsin property.</title>
<headline>First Industrial buys Wisconsin property.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Industrial Realty Trust Inc said Wednesday it acquired a light industrial property in Wauwatosa, Wisconsin, for $785,000 from American Paper &amp; Packaging.</p>
<p>The company said American Paper will lease back the 25,150 square foot property.</p>
<p>First Industrial is a real estate investment trust.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
